  "project": {
    "abstract": "We study how product-discovery quality changes as truthful, schema-valid product representations become progressively richer. Using ShoppingBench as the primary benchmark and WebShop for replication, we measure marginal attribute value, saturation, and possible degradation across lexical, dense, and LLM-based discovery pipelines.",
